    {
      "where": "TextAsset:601CustomIZ特别感谢/tips",
      "source": "<size=18>\n\n感谢你的游玩！\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<size=18>我是僵尸：冒险\n<size=12>主策：MirteorShower \n<size=18>协助制作\n<size=12><u>43056721    树桩上的火炎    爱嗑猫薄荷    小董玩得好    decepticons（关卡制作）</u>   <u>红烧黛鱼（游玩测试）</u>\n<size=18>特别感谢\n<size=12>蓝飘飘fly及其他所有融合版制作组成员\n<u>爱嗑猫薄荷   红烧黛鱼   MirteorShower（内测沟通）</u>    <u>Infinite75   听雨夜荷   梧萱梦汐X（更好的IZ编辑器）</u>\n以及能玩到这里的你\n<size=18>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",
      "english": "<size=18>\n\nThank you for playing!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<size=18>I, Zombie: Adventure\n<size=12>Lead Designer: MirteorShower \n<size=18>Contributors\n<size=12><u>43056721    树桩上的火炎    爱嗑猫薄荷    小董玩得好    decepticons (Level Design)</u>   <u>红烧黛鱼 (Playtesting)</u>\n<size=18>Special Thanks\n<size=12>蓝飘飘fly and the entire Fusion development team\n<u>爱嗑猫薄荷   红烧黛鱼   MirteorShower (Beta Coordination)</u>    <u>Infinite75   听雨夜荷   梧萱梦汐X (Improved I, Zombie Editor)</u>\nAnd you, for making it this far!\n<size=18>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",
      "kind": "exact"
    },
